      "status": "auto",
      "note": "The Fabric API layer (jfabricapi.rs) runs START_CLIENT_TICK, then the level ticks (START/END_LEVEL_TICK, while in a world), then END_CLIENT_TICK, from Horizon's tick hook, in the window's Game only."
